* Program to test go-to-definition on unresolved targets (T8, FR-17)
* Demonstrates:
* - CALLNAT #DYN (dynamic variable) → Unresolved(ReasonDynamic), no destination
* - CALLNAT 'MISSING' (literal not found) → Unresolved(ReasonNoTarget), no destination
PROGRAM UNRESOLVED-TEST

DEFINE DATA
  LOCAL
    1 #SUB-NAME (A20)
  END
END

* Dynamic call — variable target, not statically resolvable
CALLNAT #SUB-NAME

* Literal call with no matching definition in the workspace
CALLNAT 'MISSING'

END
